Mbed TLS in the host test build
-------------------------------

The panel verifies the release signature of its image with Mbed TLS
(shared/fwupdate/fw_sign.c), the copy ESP-IDF v6.1 ships: Mbed TLS 4.1.0
with TF-PSA-Crypto 1.1.0. The host test build compiles the same release
from a source tree or from the release tarball that CMake downloads and
checks against its SHA-256 (test/host/CMakeLists.txt). No Mbed TLS source
file is stored in this repository.

